                    "copy": "© 2020 Paradox Interactive AB, SURVIVING THE AFTERMATH, and PARADOX INTERACTIVE are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Paradox Interactive AB in Europe, the U.S., and other countries. Developed by ICEFLAKE STUDIOS. All other trademarks, logos, and copyrights are property of their respective owners.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
